[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Paid : pay
Pending --> Cancelled : timeout -> cancel
state "On hold" as Held
Pending --> Held : hold
Held -left-> Pending : release
state Shipped {
  [*] --> Packed
  Packed --> InTransit
  InTransit --> [*]
}
Paid --> Shipped
note right of Paid : card charged
Shipped --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
